<title>JAPAN: HIS to take 19 pct stake in discount ticketer Map.</title>
<headline>HIS to take 19 pct stake in discount ticketer Map.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tokyo discount ticket agency H.I.S Co Ltd said on Monday it would buy 76,000 new shares to be issued by another discount ticket agency, Map International Co Ltd, giving it a 19 percent stake in the company.</p>
</text>
